            "value": "Leads to: Basic Bard Spellcasting|PC1, Occult Breadth|PC1, Expert Bard Spellcasting|PC1, Master Bard Spellcasting|PC1, Basic Muse's Whispers|PC1, Advanced Muse's Whispers|PC1, Counter Perform|PC1, Anthemic Performance|PC1"
